      <body>
         <div type="edition">
            <ab xml:lang="Egyd-Egydmd egy-demp">
               <pb n="convex"/>
               <lb n="1" rend="right-to-left"/>ı͗n <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p1240"
                  >Mr-ı͗ꜣb.t tꜣ rmṯ.t (n) <surname>Ḥr-pa-ꜣs.t</surname></persName>
               <note>Cf. Den Brinker / Muhs / Vleeming, DBL (2005), 245.</note> ḥḏ (qd) ¼ <lb n="2"
               />n ḥḏ ḥmꜣ (n) ḥsb.t 36 n-ḏr.t <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p1775"
                  >Pꜣ-ḏı͗-Bꜣst.t sꜣ <surname>Ns-Ḥr</surname></persName>
               <lb n="3"/>n <date notAfter="-249-06-30" notBefore="-249-06-30"
                  when-custom="Ptolemaios_II:36">ḥsb.t 36 ı͗bd 1 šmw sw 14</date>
            </ab>
            <ab xml:lang="Grek grc">
               <pb n="convex"/>
               <lb n="4" rend="left-to-right"/>διὰ <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p4290"
                  >Δώρου</persName> (τριώβολον). </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:lang=" en">
               <pb n="convex"/>
               <lb n="1"/>Thus has brought Maigebte, the wife of Harpaesis, ¼ silver (kite) <lb
                  n="2"/>for the salt tax for the 36th regnal year. Issued by Petobastis, son of
               Esyris, <lb n="3"/>in the 36th regnal year, 14th of Pachons. <lb n="4"/>Through Doros
               3 obols. </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text></TEI>